Annotation(rdfs:comment "An OWL ontology for the pizza domain, built incrementally through the SULO Pizza Tutorial. Covers spatial composition, qualities, quantities, processes, information entities, time, and spatial containment.")
Annotation(rdfs:label "SULO Pizza Tutorial Ontology")
